b, not a separate object).\\n   Seat-level edge at u108-116 topz 0.65 -\\u003e seat ~0.65m.\\n\\n### CROSS-CHECKS in obs_0118 (all DR pose, all agree with map =\\u003e pose good to ~10cm)\\n   floor_lamp_1: gray-blue shade + dark base, base contacts u236-252 -\\u003e (-2.45, 5.75) mean. mapped (-2.45,5.85). conf 0.92-\\u003e0.94\\n   stool_1: brown blob u288-324 bottom v~317. At z=0 that gives (-1.5,7.4) = WRONG (too far).\\n     Re-projected as the SEAT FRONT EDGE at z=0.45 -\\u003e (-0.911, 5.48). mapped (-0.90,5.45) =\\u003e exact.\\n     Same elevated-edge trap as the table. Seat height ~0.45. conf 0.92-\\u003e0.94\\n   potted_plant_1: green u454-511 v316-367, pot brown u476-511 bottom CLIPPED at v511 -\\u003e (1.03..1.19, 3.07..3.16)\\n     clipped =\\u003e distance underestimated, true pot farther; consistent with locked (1.02,2.95). unchanged 0.92\\n   NO NEW OBJECTS. INVENTORY STAYS 8.\\n\\n### REVISED PLAN f119-f120 (chair already solved, so head NW to open the next segment's ground)\\n   f119: turn 0  mv 0.75 -\\u003e (0.274, 1.701) h=-30\\n   f120: turn -30 mv 0.75 -\\u003e (-0.376, 2.076) h=-60 facing WNW ; then write map.json\\nEOF\\necho ok\"}"}},{"type":"content_block_stop","index":2},{"type":"message_delta","delta":{"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null},"usage":{"input_tokens":1482,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2902,"cache_read_input_tokens":55073,"output_tokens":3254,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":806},"iterations":[{"input_tokens":1482,"output_tokens":3254,"cache_read_input_tokens":55073,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2902,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2902,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2902}},"context_management":{"applied_edits":[]}},{"type":"message_stop"}]